{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>ויתן אותי במשמר etc. אותי ואת שר האופים.</b> אותי אותי — why? I heard from the mouth of Rabbi Yehudah HaKohen that thus he said to Pharaoh: Do not suppose that he understood from my imprisonment that I had more to be saved than the chief baker, for they never treated my imprisonment more leniently than the imprisonment of the chief baker. All the days, I and the chief baker were together."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:52.366664988Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}